		{"id":"383d8b3fc498d04a","type":"text","text":"Adrenaline: Screen gets overexposed, music gets louder, kind of like we're more aware/sensitive/high. Camera moves forward to dealers table","x":4078,"y":-846,"width":331,"height":117},
		{"id":"5e73ff17f13e5c7c","type":"text","text":"Beer: We chug it while our head bobs up and down, no liquid actually shown","x":4081,"y":-720,"width":298,"height":96},
		{"id":"1bce452c1de797bb","type":"text","text":"Handsaw: We grab the gun, saw off the end by actually moving it back and forth, then look into the barrel when the end falls off","x":4080,"y":-615,"width":318,"height":116},
		{"id":"2490c8ec476721bf","type":"text","text":"Expired Medicine: We take it, Neck(camera) snaps and turns clockwise.","x":4080,"y":-491,"width":275,"height":90},
		{"id":"4651d00bc7188080","type":"text","text":"Loss: Wake up from the defibrillators","x":4447,"y":-540,"width":277,"height":93},
		{"id":"9cfe4736683a6ce3","type":"text","text":"Win: Gain health normally","x":4453,"y":-438,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f50221e3326da6c1","type":"text","text":"Cigarette: We smoke it normally","x":4080,"y":-395,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"77e2136933da1e73","type":"text","text":"Inverter: We twist the nob on it until it starts beeping and blinking lights","x":4077,"y":-327,"width":307,"height":78},
		{"id":"d0692299400397b0","type":"text","text":"Handcuffs: Hands it to Dealer, he handcuffs himself, not to table","x":4079,"y":-241,"width":283,"height":60},
		{"id":"8dca08031f229f41","type":"text","text":"Magnifying Glass: Smashes it against table, stabs it into table, checks current Shell normally without physically using magnifying glass","x":4083,"y":-1095,"width":380,"height":117},
		{"id":"60ada6fbd861fc1b","type":"text","text":"Burner Phone: We stare at the phone while camera zooms in and audio noise gets louder. Kind of like we're being hypnotized. Breaks the phone in half after","x":4080,"y":-973,"width":347,"height":119},
		{"id":"ad0e4185c41f6e0e","type":"text","text":"Inverter: Punches it until it breaks","x":3592,"y":-1166,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"483616deb28fe5c7","type":"text","text":"Handcuffs: Handcuffs us to the table","x":3592,"y":-1092,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2bffa06034ea9b30","type":"text","text":"Loss: Falls Down with a loud thud and camera shake","x":3993,"y":-1353,"width":245,"height":60},
		{"id":"28dea3de29b65cdc","type":"text","text":"Expired Medicine: Pops it into their and catches it in his mouth, like candy","x":3591,"y":-1330,"width":317,"height":85},
		{"id":"20dabc86ca65b307","type":"text","text":"Win: Nothing","x":3994,"y":-1288,"width":250,"height":60},
