		{"id":"21626204f97781da","type":"text","text":"Only front side ever seen","x":1267,"y":-1679,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"43ff3ab1bba1148d","type":"text","text":"Potato like face","x":1264,"y":-1615,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"16f4dc3fcc669cdd","type":"text","text":"Floating head and hands","x":1264,"y":-1554,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3b8340d9b5a09a18","type":"text","text":"Before first shot: Smiling, somewhat normal face","x":1264,"y":-1488,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7555425f5cbbc67f","type":"text","text":"Cutscene","x":701,"y":-1287,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"7f6e195c6a85e21d","type":"text","text":"After Shot: Messed up face, Jagged teeth pointing out","x":1262,"y":-1424,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"79b51c75b72cc567","type":"text","text":"Never Shown, No hands either","x":614,"y":-1590,"width":326,"height":54},
		{"id":"5c54d328a80b5a86","type":"text","text":"Mostly baked in, kind of Dynamic","x":753,"y":-1672,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1a0908e2004125e8","type":"text","text":"Camera","x":420,"y":-1869,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"295879fbae9e7c6b","type":"text","text":"Snappy Movements","x":752,"y":-1868,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"639b898cff1fb18b","type":"text","text":"Low Poly Models","x":418,"y":-1803,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8154231e69049e68","type":"text","text":"Can see distinct color edges","x":750,"y":-1799,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6c4bd4d1ebd1a2dc","type":"text","text":"Limited Color Range","x":416,"y":-1736,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"34ebc2ab63cf9894","type":"text","text":"Like the Threshold effect in photoshop","x":749,"y":-1736,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"fafc338890db5506","type":"text","text":"Absurd","x":418,"y":-1939,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"958da593ce6e8425","type":"text","text":"Impossible, unexplained things happen, Doesn't try to be realistic","x":754,"y":-1963,"width":257,"height":91},
		{"id":"caf08c142d55edec","type":"text","text":"Shotgun end reappears out of thin air","x":1124,"y":-1933,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7b11b7caa3b298d5","type":"text","text":"Cigarette Heals","x":1124,"y":-2001,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5a6424dcffc4fc61","type":"text","text":"The \"GOD\" Contract covered in blood","x":1102,"y":-1083,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"38c821ca4a124aaa","type":"text","text":"Easter Eggs","x":805,"y":-1079,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"cc012ef07037c83a","type":"text","text":"Implies God played and died in these games","x":1410,"y":-1083,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"39a4fbaf7ed9435b","type":"text","text":"Makes the Dealer (Enemy) a supernatural mysterious being","x":1716,"y":-1085,"width":287,"height":64},
		{"id":"dfa4dc2e1045c929","type":"text","text":"Start: In a club bathroom, mirror says afraid? Clicking on the door makes us kick open the door and walk out into the club. We're on the upper deck, blue flashing club lights, man smoking on ledge. We kick down the door at the end of the hallway. Enter main game area","x":1610,"y":-1417,"width":530,"height":132},
		{"id":"faad2bf78fafdafe","type":"text","text":"End, Win: Opens briefcase of money, screen turns black, fades back into a car. Camera is on dashboard near drivers seat pointing to the money in the side passenger seat. Stats shown","x":1607,"y":-1272,"width":490,"height":85},
		{"id":"0eb419cc90058147","type":"text","text":"No resolution, No glory before death","x":1514,"y":-1174,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3f1cd2bc1e1faff0","type":"text","text":"End, Loss: Back to main menu","x":1088,"y":-1200,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8e5cc25946d80dab","type":"text","text":"Lots of muted reds, dark greens, browns, greys","x":755,"y":-2033,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f53bcac36613c094","type":"text","text":"Color","x":418,"y":-2005,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
